(5750557, 836926, 33736, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one, but the unlevel lines of the colored blocks of light were so distracting.  It was hard to keep my eyes on the person and the suspended utensils.  Realizing that this one would have been hard to shoot with the white chef''s coat, the shinier whisk and spatula opposed to the darker cleaver and whatever is in his left hand, it still didn''t get my highest marks.  However, kudos on what you did capture.</td>', 'I really liked this one, but the unlevel lines of the colored blocks of light were so distracting.  It was hard to keep my eyes on the person and the suspended utensils.  Realizing that this one would have been hard to shoot with the white chef''s coat, the shinier whisk and spatula opposed to the darker cleaver and whatever is in his left hand, it still didn''t get my highest marks.  However, kudos on what you did capture.', '2009-12-02 13:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750609, 836178, 60571, '<td valign="top">Very clean and well executed, but it comes across as a little flat I think. 6</td>', 'Very clean and well executed, but it comes across as a little flat I think. 6', '2009-12-02 13:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
