(5750867, 836752, 107027, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!  I love the composition of this photo (the DOF, the angle, the fact that you cropped the photographers head to make the viewer focus on the tools).  Really great photo overall (I voted as soon as voting began and gave you a 9!)</td>', 'Beautiful shot!  I love the composition of this photo (the DOF, the angle, the fact that you cropped the photographers head to make the viewer focus on the tools).  Really great photo overall (I voted as soon as voting began and gave you a 9!)', '2009-12-02 16:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750877, 836178, 107027, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I love the colors, the simplicity and the feel of this photograph.  The composition is great and the flower looks awesome.  (I voted as soon as voting began and gave you a 9!)</td>', 'Great shot!  I love the colors, the simplicity and the feel of this photograph.  The composition is great and the flower looks awesome.  (I voted as soon as voting began and gave you a 9!)', '2009-12-02 16:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750878, 837136, 107027, '<td valign="top">Cool photo.  To me this looks like a real workshop.  You could almost imagine that the Doll Maker walked away for just a moment to get a new can of paint.  The composition is authentic, the lighting is nice and the subject is clear.  Well done! 8</td>', 'Cool photo.  To me this looks like a real workshop.  You could almost imagine that the Doll Maker walked away for just a moment to get a new can of paint.  The composition is authentic, the lighting is nice and the subject is clear.  Well done! 8', '2009-12-02 16:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5750885, 837041, 107027, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  That knife grinder in action looks great.  The overall photo has a nice old school feel to it.  It makes me think that the person in this shot really makes his living using this tool of the trade.  Great job, I voted when voting began and gave you an 8!</td>', 'I really like this shot.  That knife grinder in action looks great.  The overall photo has a nice old school feel to it.  It makes me think that the person in this shot really makes his living using this tool of the trade.  Great job, I voted when voting began and gave you an 8!', '2009-12-02 16:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
