(5756238, 836917, 554, '<td valign="top">Looks like a shot from the late forties or fifties.....if b/w.<br/>Good one.</td>', 'Looks like a shot from the late forties or fifties.....if b/w.Good one.', '2009-12-05 20:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756429, 836917, 70852, '<td valign="top">Very nice. 10 from me.</td>', 'Very nice. 10 from me.', '2009-12-06 00:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756468, 836967, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and setup, good lighting. Not liking the skin tones.</td>', 'Nice idea and setup, good lighting. Not liking the skin tones.', '2009-12-06 02:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756622, 837027, 102278, '<td valign="top">Whilst i don''t agree with the propaganda of the title, the image is a good effective simple composition that works well. The uniform tone is also good.</td>', 'Whilst i don''t agree with the propaganda of the title, the image is a good effective simple composition that works well. The uniform tone is also good.', '2009-12-06 09:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756780, 837126, 90414, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, love the reflection and lighting. My only criticism is that a professional violinist certainly doesn''t need finger position markers. Otherwise a great photo.</td>', 'Very nice image, love the reflection and lighting. My only criticism is that a professional violinist certainly doesn''t need finger position markers. Otherwise a great photo.', '2009-12-06 12:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756818, 837126, 73348, '<td valign="top">I would have left the rosin out, but I still like it. 8</td>', 'I would have left the rosin out, but I still like it. 8', '2009-12-06 13:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756831, 836978, 5364, '<td valign="top">This appeals to me. Going monochrome feels like exactly the right thing to do. The strong diagonal is good and the depth of field is just right.</td>', 'This appeals to me. Going monochrome feels like exactly the right thing to do. The strong diagonal is good and the depth of field is just right.', '2009-12-06 13:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756839, 837008, 5364, '<td valign="top">The warm tone is lovely but I''m not sure the composition is quite right. I think it''s the background that''s throwing me off.</td>', 'The warm tone is lovely but I''m not sure the composition is quite right. I think it''s the background that''s throwing me off.', '2009-12-06 13:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756841, 836754, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is really good and my only quibble is that the metronome isn''t quite  vertical.</td>', 'This is really good and my only quibble is that the metronome isn''t quite  vertical.', '2009-12-06 13:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5756844, 836937, 5364, '<td valign="top">An good subject but for me the composition could have been more interesting. I feel the tools could have been at more of an angle to the picture and the picture itself would be better if it was the right way round rather than being on it''s side.</td>', 'An good subject but for me the composition could have been more interesting. I feel the tools could have been at more of an angle to the picture and the picture itself would be better if it was the right way round rather than being on it''s side.', '2009-12-06 13:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757050, 836104, 81530, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the wall</td>', 'Love the texture of the wall', '2009-12-06 17:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757254, 837127, 106233, '<td valign="top">So sorry for your mistake on submitting. This is a great picture for tilt shift. Very nice DOF illusion, and it would probably score well on there.</td>', 'So sorry for your mistake on submitting. This is a great picture for tilt shift. Very nice DOF illusion, and it would probably score well on there.', '2009-12-06 20:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757406, 837148, 52336, '<td valign="top">Straight lines are notoriously hard to sharpen effectively.  The result is the jaggies in this photo.  If you had controlled that, perhaps with more restrained sharpening, and composed it abit differently (the ruler and slide rule are out of frame, and the position of the tools aren''t too interesting, and the diagram is a bit too straight up and down), this might have been more successful. 5</td>', 'Straight lines are notoriously hard to sharpen effectively.  The result is the jaggies in this photo.  If you had controlled that, perhaps with more restrained sharpening, and composed it abit differently (the ruler and slide rule are out of frame, and the position of the tools aren''t too interesting, and the diagram is a bit too straight up and down), this might have been more successful. 5', '2009-12-06 22:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757664, 836958, 111729, '<td valign="top">nice interpretation of the topic......only criticsm would be that you could have used a ghd straightener!</td>', 'nice interpretation of the topic......only criticsm would be that you could have used a ghd straightener!', '2009-12-07 03:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757886, 836104, 112667, '<td valign="top">a bit dark but it could be my monitor</td>', 'a bit dark but it could be my monitor', '2009-12-07 09:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757896, 837126, 112667, '<td valign="top">i find the bow a bit distracting</td>', 'i find the bow a bit distracting', '2009-12-07 09:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5757912, 837126, 112455, '<td valign="top">So good</td>', 'So good', '2009-12-07 09:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758165, 836969, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kinda dim, grainy and the subject my eye is drawn to is very much out of focus. Not sure there is really much post processing that could help this shot. If you were to reshoot it, I would suggest having some of the items completely in the frame, try some different lighting and to watch the focus.</td>', 'Kinda dim, grainy and the subject my eye is drawn to is very much out of focus. Not sure there is really much post processing that could help this shot. If you were to reshoot it, I would suggest having some of the items completely in the frame, try some different lighting and to watch the focus.', '2009-12-07 13:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758166, 836973, 83313, '<td valign="top">Who is Taylor?</td>', 'Who is Taylor?', '2009-12-07 13:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
