(5758200, 837027, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, don''t care for the sepia treatment, however. Somehow it does not seem appropriate for modern combat gear. An intense, contrasty b/w would work better with me for this subject.</td>', 'I like the shot, don''t care for the sepia treatment, however. Somehow it does not seem appropriate for modern combat gear. An intense, contrasty b/w would work better with me for this subject.', '2009-12-07 13:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758203, 836191, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but the harsh lighting (onboard flash?) does not do it justice.</td>', 'A good idea, but the harsh lighting (onboard flash?) does not do it justice.', '2009-12-07 13:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758314, 836949, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is an OK image but I find myself wanting to see more of the machine.</td>', 'This is an OK image but I find myself wanting to see more of the machine.', '2009-12-07 15:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758317, 837000, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like this. I feel you made a good decision to photograph only part of the guitar, and you''ve done it well.</td>', 'I like this. I feel you made a good decision to photograph only part of the guitar, and you''ve done it well.', '2009-12-07 15:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758320, 836945, 5364, '<td valign="top">I find this image fascinating to look at. The composition works for me.</td>', 'I find this image fascinating to look at. The composition works for me.', '2009-12-07 15:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758324, 835705, 5364, '<td valign="top">While it''s technically well taken, I find the composition doesn''t quite work for me. I think I''d rather have seen the bassoon at more of an angle across the frame rather than horizontal, especially as you''ve cropped off both ends.</td>', 'While it''s technically well taken, I find the composition doesn''t quite work for me. I think I''d rather have seen the bassoon at more of an angle across the frame rather than horizontal, especially as you''ve cropped off both ends.', '2009-12-07 15:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758329, 837116, 5364, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling to find much to say about this. It''s technically good, but doesn''t have a great deal of interest. As there''s very little colour here I can''t help wondering what it would look like in monochrome.</td>', 'I''m struggling to find much to say about this. It''s technically good, but doesn''t have a great deal of interest. As there''s very little colour here I can''t help wondering what it would look like in monochrome.', '2009-12-07 15:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758333, 837020, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I can''t help feeling that the harsh lighting is somewhat counteracting the mood of the painting.</td>', 'I like this, but I can''t help feeling that the harsh lighting is somewhat counteracting the mood of the painting.', '2009-12-07 15:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758396, 835961, 30454, '<td valign="top">Flash directly hitting the subject creats dark shadows, making this as ususal snapshot.</td>', 'Flash directly hitting the subject creats dark shadows, making this as ususal snapshot.', '2009-12-07 16:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758398, 836973, 30454, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the pins, but flat lighting on the resting objects. Also, too many of the pins, the same theme can be conveyted with the fewer pins(may be just one or two to make it simplistic) and dramatic light.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the pins, but flat lighting on the resting objects. Also, too many of the pins, the same theme can be conveyted with the fewer pins(may be just one or two to make it simplistic) and dramatic light.', '2009-12-07 16:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758402, 836930, 30454, '<td valign="top">Food doesn''t look appetizing at all, sorry for the low vote. The lighting is the important aspect when taking food shots, which is completely ingnored here. The plate looks gross unless that was the intension.</td>', 'Food doesn''t look appetizing at all, sorry for the low vote. The lighting is the important aspect when taking food shots, which is completely ingnored here. The plate looks gross unless that was the intension.', '2009-12-07 16:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5758403, 837008, 30454, '<td valign="top">Flat lighting. The BG color on which the cap is resting is mixing the color with the woolen cap. Too busy with colors, don''t know where to look.</td>', 'Flat lighting. The BG color on which the cap is resting is mixing the color with the woolen cap. Too busy with colors, don''t know where to look.', '2009-12-07 16:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
