(5759378, 836976, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great pov.  Fun shot.  Love the pastels.  I feel like a border ("frame") might have "completed" this shot.</td>', 'Great pov.  Fun shot.  Love the pastels.  I feel like a border ("frame") might have "completed" this shot.', '2009-12-07 23:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759379, 836945, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is such a busy shot.  I think a more narrow focus, or a narrower subject selection would have improved this shot.    Too much competing for my attention, and it feels oversharpened.</td>', 'This is such a busy shot.  I think a more narrow focus, or a narrower subject selection would have improved this shot.    Too much competing for my attention, and it feels oversharpened.', '2009-12-07 23:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759380, 836104, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great mood lighting, nice tones, stellar lighting, although maybe a bit too bright on the face and left hand.</td>', 'Great mood lighting, nice tones, stellar lighting, although maybe a bit too bright on the face and left hand.', '2009-12-07 23:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759381, 836937, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the lighting from the left helped this image.  I think the cutout edges might have been more interesting than their handles.</td>', 'I don''t know if the lighting from the left helped this image.  I think the cutout edges might have been more interesting than their handles.', '2009-12-07 23:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759382, 837126, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, clean reflection.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Beautiful, clean reflection.  Nice shot.', '2009-12-07 23:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759385, 837116, 96751, '<td valign="top">Intriguing tools.  Very sharp and nice detail, but the lighting could be alittle more dramatic.</td>', 'Intriguing tools.  Very sharp and nice detail, but the lighting could be alittle more dramatic.', '2009-12-07 23:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759390, 836752, 96751, '<td valign="top">AAAcck!!!  I''d pass out from the cute.  Just commenting now.<br/> <br/>Every time I click on this image I just want to hug the critter.  How lucky to have witnessed this.  The content of this image surpasses any other "tool" shot, as it tells a story and has an emotion.  Love how the pup is looking up.  Did I mention I love cute things?????</td>', 'AAAcck!!!  I''d pass out from the cute.  Just commenting now. Every time I click on this image I just want to hug the critter.  How lucky to have witnessed this.  The content of this image surpasses any other "tool" shot, as it tells a story and has an emotion.  Love how the pup is looking up.  Did I mention I love cute things?????', '2009-12-07 23:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759408, 835862, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic capture, especially of the mist, and the glint on his "tools".  I feel that the body position could have been better, more dynamic.  Instead, it looks like he''s between moments.</td>', 'Very dramatic capture, especially of the mist, and the glint on his "tools".  I feel that the body position could have been better, more dynamic.  Instead, it looks like he''s between moments.', '2009-12-08 00:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
