(5759412, 835841, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and dramatic, although maybe a bit too dramatic on the lighting, especially near the handle of the cleaver.  What is that thing just below it, in the dark?</td>', 'Beautiful and dramatic, although maybe a bit too dramatic on the lighting, especially near the handle of the cleaver.  What is that thing just below it, in the dark?', '2009-12-08 00:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
