(5759419, 837000, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice clean image, but the composition feels chopped off. Perhaps an angle that would have the neck disappear into a blur, rather than cropped off?</td>', 'Nice clean image, but the composition feels chopped off. Perhaps an angle that would have the neck disappear into a blur, rather than cropped off?', '2009-12-08 00:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
