(5759447, 836978, 96751, '<td valign="top">Although the subject is very interesting, I find the lighting rather flat.</td>', 'Although the subject is very interesting, I find the lighting rather flat.', '2009-12-08 00:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759448, 836973, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something so sweet about this shot.  Love those pinheads!</td>', 'There is something so sweet about this shot.  Love those pinheads!', '2009-12-08 00:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759451, 835840, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent stop motion.  Nice focus on the nail!</td>', 'Excellent stop motion.  Nice focus on the nail!', '2009-12-08 00:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759455, 837020, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing shot.  Love the painting as well.  Maybe cropped slightly tighter off the top.</td>', 'Very intriguing shot.  Love the painting as well.  Maybe cropped slightly tighter off the top.', '2009-12-08 00:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759456, 837046, 96751, '<td valign="top">The best (and scariest) of the dental shots.  Great background colors, and simple yet affective choice for main subject.</td>', 'The best (and scariest) of the dental shots.  Great background colors, and simple yet affective choice for main subject.', '2009-12-08 00:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759542, 836620, 106543, '<td valign="top">-1 for the Nikon gear ;) hehe just kidding. I gave it a 9, my favourite in this challenge.</td>', '-1 for the Nikon gear ;) hehe just kidding. I gave it a 9, my favourite in this challenge.', '2009-12-08 01:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759716, 836973, 5364, '<td valign="top">This is good but it''s a but the colour of the pin-cushion is a bit unfortunate - it makes it look like you''ve photographed some extreme acupuncture!</td>', 'This is good but it''s a but the colour of the pin-cushion is a bit unfortunate - it makes it look like you''ve photographed some extreme acupuncture!', '2009-12-08 07:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759938, 835626, 87252, '<td valign="top">Mmmm looks tasty, nice lighting and comp, the DOF is cool too but might lose you DPC points!</td>', 'Mmmm looks tasty, nice lighting and comp, the DOF is cool too but might lose you DPC points!', '2009-12-08 12:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759940, 837122, 87252, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like how the lighting really isolates the subject, bit of a shoehorn though :-)</td>', 'Nice shot, I like how the lighting really isolates the subject, bit of a shoehorn though :-)', '2009-12-08 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759942, 836752, 87252, '<td valign="top">Cute factor 10, I think even the most steely hearted of DPCers will let out an awwwww at this one.</td>', 'Cute factor 10, I think even the most steely hearted of DPCers will let out an awwwww at this one.', '2009-12-08 12:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759943, 836657, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sick, I like it :)</td>', 'Sick, I like it :)', '2009-12-08 12:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759945, 837015, 87252, '<td valign="top">Sweet, you can''t beat a novelty guitar.</td>', 'Sweet, you can''t beat a novelty guitar.', '2009-12-08 12:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759948, 836917, 87252, '<td valign="top">Now this is very creative, I love the 50s advertising feel. Great model, pose expression and prop. My thoughts on improving this would be a) be more selective with your background features, in this case I think if you just had the cupboards and to the right and less of the window/ sink it''d be a bit tidier. b) Slightly sharper focus on the model''s face, c) the lighting is not quite there, it seems slightly too harsh and the colour balance is a bit cold.</td>', 'Now this is very creative, I love the 50s advertising feel. Great model, pose expression and prop. My thoughts on improving this would be a) be more selective with your background features, in this case I think if you just had the cupboards and to the right and less of the window/ sink it''d be a bit tidier. b) Slightly sharper focus on the model''s face, c) the lighting is not quite there, it seems slightly too harsh and the colour balance is a bit cold.', '2009-12-08 12:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759960, 836178, 2490, '<td valign="top">Love the colors :)</td>', 'Love the colors :)', '2009-12-08 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759961, 836976, 2490, '<td valign="top">Somehow it''s just a confusing image, even though I know what it is.</td>', 'Somehow it''s just a confusing image, even though I know what it is.', '2009-12-08 12:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759962, 835841, 2490, '<td valign="top">I think you need just a touch more light on the cleaver.  At first I thought it was a bottle.</td>', 'I think you need just a touch more light on the cleaver.  At first I thought it was a bottle.', '2009-12-08 12:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759963, 837110, 2490, '<td valign="top">I like the sparks but I would llike more light on the torch, I think.</td>', 'I like the sparks but I would llike more light on the torch, I think.', '2009-12-08 12:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759965, 835981, 2490, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh.  Maybe you intended that?</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh.  Maybe you intended that?', '2009-12-08 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759966, 836936, 2490, '<td valign="top">Well done shot, but somehow the composition makes my eye wander.</td>', 'Well done shot, but somehow the composition makes my eye wander.', '2009-12-08 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759967, 836590, 2490, '<td valign="top">I r 1 of these :)</td>', 'I r 1 of these :)', '2009-12-08 12:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759969, 837148, 2490, '<td valign="top">Where''s your lettering template!!!! :)</td>', 'Where''s your lettering template!!!! :)', '2009-12-08 12:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759970, 836937, 2490, '<td valign="top">The woodgrain ruins it for me.  Not sure if it''s the color, or what.</td>', 'The woodgrain ruins it for me.  Not sure if it''s the color, or what.', '2009-12-08 12:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759973, 837030, 2490, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I''ve used these.  Never hobbed any gears, though.</td>', 'Yeah, I''ve used these.  Never hobbed any gears, though.', '2009-12-08 12:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759975, 837099, 2490, '<td valign="top">That''s a fat looking needle.  Not as fat as the IV I once had in my neck, but anyway.</td>', 'That''s a fat looking needle.  Not as fat as the IV I once had in my neck, but anyway.', '2009-12-08 12:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759978, 837114, 2490, '<td valign="top">Whatever all that is lying on probably makes perfect sense to you, but I just can''t figure out what it is, and that confuses me. :)</td>', 'Whatever all that is lying on probably makes perfect sense to you, but I just can''t figure out what it is, and that confuses me. :)', '2009-12-08 12:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5759980, 837043, 2490, '<td valign="top">The picture is sentimental, but doesn''t make much sense in context - to me.</td>', 'The picture is sentimental, but doesn''t make much sense in context - to me.', '2009-12-08 12:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760048, 836917, 5364, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo but to my eye it either needed to be straightened up or your model needed to be leaning the other direction.</td>', 'Excellent photo but to my eye it either needed to be straightened up or your model needed to be leaning the other direction.', '2009-12-08 13:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760051, 836042, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like what you''ve done here, but as you''ve cropped the top off I feel you would have been better cropping off the sides as well so that you lost the corner of the patina and the cable from the soldering iron.</td>', 'I like what you''ve done here, but as you''ve cropped the top off I feel you would have been better cropping off the sides as well so that you lost the corner of the patina and the cable from the soldering iron.', '2009-12-08 13:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760054, 837129, 30454, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I like the light stream coming out of the camera.</td>', 'This is nice. I like the light stream coming out of the camera.', '2009-12-08 13:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760070, 836657, 99506, '<td valign="top">remind me not to go to your doctors then lol</td>', 'remind me not to go to your doctors then lol', '2009-12-08 14:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760071, 837020, 108982, '<td valign="top">Is the painting for sale?  Fantastic use of the challenge, excellent texture and gray scale.  If not by accident, the use of the thin black border was brilliant, it makes the harsh shadow (right of thumb)from direct lighting or flash seem as though it was intended and belongs.  Absolutely my favorite in this group...10</td>', 'Is the painting for sale?  Fantastic use of the challenge, excellent texture and gray scale.  If not by accident, the use of the thin black border was brilliant, it makes the harsh shadow (right of thumb)from direct lighting or flash seem as though it was intended and belongs.  Absolutely my favorite in this group...10', '2009-12-08 14:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760073, 835846, 108982, '<td valign="top">beautiful use of varied texture and color, I like that you used a narrow DOF to have only clear focus on the pattered shoe.  Gains almost an abstract quality the longer one observes...a top 5 no doubt...9</td>', 'beautiful use of varied texture and color, I like that you used a narrow DOF to have only clear focus on the pattered shoe.  Gains almost an abstract quality the longer one observes...a top 5 no doubt...9', '2009-12-08 14:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760075, 837126, 108982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rich colors.  nice composition but I find the 2 separate sets of converging lines created by bow/bow and neck/neck a little distracting.  I would rather see the bow in front with the block of resin (it looks orphaned) but that is truly just an opinion.  great capture!...8</td>', 'Beautiful rich colors.  nice composition but I find the 2 separate sets of converging lines created by bow/bow and neck/neck a little distracting.  I would rather see the bow in front with the block of resin (it looks orphaned) but that is truly just an opinion.  great capture!...8', '2009-12-08 14:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760077, 837041, 108982, '<td valign="top">capture is really good.  a bit tighter focus at the hands would have made this even better...8</td>', 'capture is really good.  a bit tighter focus at the hands would have made this even better...8', '2009-12-08 14:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760079, 836612, 108982, '<td valign="top">nice photo.7</td>', 'nice photo.7', '2009-12-08 14:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5760080, 837032, 108982, '<td valign="top">unique idea great B&amp;W choice.7</td>', 'unique idea great B&W choice.7', '2009-12-08 14:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
