(5761254, 837122, 54844, '<td valign="top">Post challenge comments from my phone.<br/>I heard the term shoehorn a few times in the comments. I would have to agree, it was a shoehorn, but I looked at this challenge differently. I would have not entered this challenge if he didn''t have cash in the cup on top of the piano.<br/>I am a tradesman, a union tradesman, so when it comes to tools of the trade, I fully understand! But, I do not care who you are or what ou do, Ýou have a trade if you have a job and earn money. This guy would have not been playing the piano in a lounge if there was no one there. He was playing for them, and the crowd made him better. <br/>One comment by a newby who deleted their account before the challenge was complete. It is just that, a challenge, not a contest.</td>', 'Post challenge comments from my phone.I heard the term shoehorn a few times in the comments. I would have to agree, it was a shoehorn, but I looked at this challenge differently. I would have not entered this challenge if he didn''t have cash in the cup on top of the piano.I am a tradesman, a union tradesman, so when it comes to tools of the trade, I fully understand! But, I do not care who you are or what ou do, Ýou have a trade if you have a job and earn money. This guy would have not been playing the piano in a lounge if there was no one there. He was playing for them, and the crowd made him better. One comment by a newby who deleted their account before the challenge was complete. It is just that, a challenge, not a contest.', '2009-12-09 09:33:18.000000', NULL, 0),
