(5762836, 836754, 49865, '<td valign="top">Wow I like the old school metronome. I can''t decide if the amount of motion blur is just right, or a little too much. I have to disagree with Mephisto here, this photograph screams ''music'' to me. In any event the focus is on the conductor''s tools, from the baton to the creative use of conductor''s sheet music as a subtle background to make the subjects pop.</td>', 'Wow I like the old school metronome. I can''t decide if the amount of motion blur is just right, or a little too much. I have to disagree with Mephisto here, this photograph screams ''music'' to me. In any event the focus is on the conductor''s tools, from the baton to the creative use of conductor''s sheet music as a subtle background to make the subjects pop.', '2009-12-10 10:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
